    "text": "This is a greedy, event-driven scheduler. It never moves services and never creates binaries, so the validity rules are easy to satisfy.\n\n**Approach**\n- **Jobs.** For each feature, collect the set of binaries that hold its services. Each binary in that set becomes one job, \"implement F in B\". The job's base length is `D_F + R_B`. Features whose longest job cannot finish before `L` are discarded.\n- **Feature order.** Features are sorted by a priority of the form `U \u00b7 (L \u2212 lat)^c / work^a`.\n  - `work` is the total engineer-days of the feature's jobs.\n  - `lat` is the length of its longest job.\n- **Simulation.** Events are processed in time order. When an engineer becomes free on day `t`:\n  - The engineer takes the next pending job of the current feature. Jobs within a feature are taken longest first.\n  - The job's duration is `D + R_B + C_B`. Engineers freed on the same day are processed in index order, so `C_B` follows the statement's \"listed earlier counts first\" rule.\n- **Opening features.** A new feature is opened only when the current one has no pending jobs left. It is opened only if all its jobs would fit now.\n- **Abandoning features.** If a job would not finish before `L`, the feature is abandoned. Tasks already started stay in the output; they are valid, just wasted.\n- **Retiring.** Engineers with nothing left to do simply stop.\n\n**Why the output is valid**\n- Each (feature, binary) pair is implemented at most once, so the same feature is never worked on concurrently in one binary.\n- No moves are made, so the move-locking rules never apply.\n- Every assigned task finishes before `L`, and each task lasts at least one day. So each engineer has at most `L` tasks.\n\nSeveral priority variants are simulated. The program keeps the one with the best simulated score.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint L,G,S,B,F,N;\nvector<string> sname, fname;\nvector<int> sbin;\nvector<int> Dv, Uv;\nvector<vector<int>> jobs; // binaries per feature sorted by R desc\nvector<int> R;\n\nstruct Result{ long long score; vector<vector<pair<int,int>>> tasks; };\n\nResult simulate(const vector<int>& order, bool record){\n    Result res; res.score=0;\n    if(record) res.tasks.assign(G,{});\n    vector<int> cnt(B,0);\n    priority_queue<pair<int,int>,vector<pair<int,int>>,greater<pair<int,int>>> ev, ends;\n    for(int e=0;e<G;e++) ev.push({0,e});\n    vector<int> finishMax(F,0), assigned(F,0);\n    vector<char> doomed(F,0), opened(F,0);\n    size_t p=0; int cur=-1; size_t jp=0;\n    while(!ev.empty()){\n        auto [t,e]=ev.top(); ev.pop();\n        if(t>=L) continue;\n        while(!ends.empty() && ends.top().first<=t){ cnt[ends.top().second]--; ends.pop(); }\n        bool got=false;\n        while(true){\n            if(cur>=0 && jp<jobs[cur].size()){\n                int b=jobs[cur][jp];\n                int dur=Dv[cur]+R[b]+cnt[b];\n                if(t+dur<L){\n                    jp++;\n                    cnt[b]++;\n                    ends.push({t+dur,b});\n                    ev.push({t+dur,e});\n                    assigned[cur]++;\n                    finishMax[cur]=max(finishMax[cur],t+dur);\n                    if(record) res.tasks[e].push_back({cur,b});\n                    got=true; break;\n                } else { doomed[cur]=1; cur=-1; continue; }\n            }\n            // open next feature\n            cur=-1;\n            bool found=false;\n            while(p<order.size()){\n                int f=order[p++];\n                int mx=0;\n                for(int b:jobs[f]) mx=max(mx,Dv[f]+R[b]+cnt[b]);\n                if(t+mx<L){ cur=f; jp=0; opened[f]=1; found=true; break; }\n            }\n            if(!found) break;\n        }\n        (void)got;\n    }\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n        if(opened[f] && !doomed[f] && assigned[f]==(int)jobs[f].size() && finishMax[f]<L)\n            res.score+=(long long)Uv[f]*(L-finishMax[f]);\n    }\n    return res;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false); cin.tie(nullptr);\n    cin>>L>>G>>S>>B>>F>>N;\n    sname.resize(S); sbin.resize(S);\n    unordered_map<string,int> sid; sid.reserve(S*2);\n    R.assign(B,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<S;i++){ cin>>sname[i]>>sbin[i]; sid[sname[i]]=i; R[sbin[i]]++; }\n    fname.resize(F); Dv.resize(F); Uv.resize(F); jobs.resize(F);\n    for(int i=0;i<F;i++){\n        int M; cin>>fname[i]>>M>>Dv[i]>>Uv[i];\n        vector<int> bs; bs.reserve(M);\n        for(int j=0;j<M;j++){ string s; cin>>s; bs.push_back(sbin[sid[s]]); }\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end()); bs.erase(unique(bs.begin(),bs.end()),bs.end());\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end(),[&](int a,int b){ if(R[a]!=R[b]) return R[a]>R[b]; return a<b;});\n        jobs[i]=bs;\n    }\n    vector<double> work(F), lat(F);\n    vector<int> valid;\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n        double w=0,l=0;\n        for(int b:jobs[f]){ double d=Dv[f]+R[b]; w+=d; l=max(l,d);}\n        work[f]=w; lat[f]=l;\n        if(l<L) valid.push_back(f);\n    }\n    vector<pair<double,double>> variants={{1,0},{1,1},{0.5,1},{1.5,1},{0,1},{1,2},{0.75,1},{2,1}};\n    long long best=-1; vector<int> bestOrder;\n    auto startT=chrono::steady_clock::now();\n    for(auto [a,c]:variants){\n        double el=chrono::duration<double>(chrono::steady_clock::now()-startT).count();\n        if(el>6.0) break;\n        vector<double> key(F,0);\n        for(int f:valid) key[f]=log((double)Uv[f])+c*log((double)(L-lat[f]))-a*log(work[f]);\n        vector<int> ord=valid;\n        stable_sort(ord.begin(),ord.end(),[&](int x,int y){ return key[x]>key[y]; });\n        Result r=simulate(ord,false);\n        if(r.score>best){ best=r.score; bestOrder=ord; }\n    }\n    Result r=simulate(bestOrder,true);\n    string out;\n    int E=0;\n    for(int e=0;e<G;e++) if(!r.tasks[e].empty()) E++;\n    out+=to_string(E)+\"\\n\";\n    for(int e=0;e<G;e++){\n        if(r.tasks[e].empty()) continue;\n        out+=to_string(r.tasks[e].size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(auto [f,b]:r.tasks[e]){\n            out+=\"impl \"; out+=fname[f]; out+=' '; out+=to_string(b); out+='\\n';\n        }\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
